<body class="category-page">
<a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Skip to content</a>
{% include "partials/topbar.njk" %}
<main id="main-content">
  <div class="frame page">
    <h1 class="page-title">New to Vancouver? Start here.</h1>
    <p class="page-lede">Vancouver can feel like a hard city to meet people. These groups are free (or cheap), beginner-friendly, and welcoming to newcomers. Just show up.</p>
    <div class="columns">
      <div class="col-main">
        <section class="panel">
          <h2 class="panel-title">Get moving</h2>
          <ul class="panel-body link-list">
            <li><a href="/hiking-outdoors/#y-adventure-kommunity-(yak)">Y Adventure Kommunity (YAK)</a><span class="link-list-note">Free adventure club — hiking, paddle boarding, biking, bouldering, and camping to make friends through outdoor activities.</span></li>
            <li><a href="/run-clubs/#social-run-club">Social Run Club</a><span class="link-list-note">Social runs for beginner to intermediate runners. Fun runs, not competitive. Just show up.</span></li>
            <li><a href="/dance/#rueda-de-la-vida---friday-free-community-salsa%2Fbachata">Rueda de la Vida</a><span class="link-list-note">Free outdoor Latin dance every Friday with a beginner lesson at 7pm. No partner needed.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="panel">
          <h2 class="panel-title">Make friends</h2>
          <ul class="panel-body link-list">
            <li><a href="/social-friend-clubs/#we-should-be-friends">We Should Be Friends</a><span class="link-list-note">Park hangs, pottery nights, spin classes, neighbourhood book clubs — focused on lasting friendships.</span></li>
            <li><a href="/dinner-supper-clubs/#dayofus---dinner-with-strangers">DayOfUs — Dinner with Strangers</a><span class="link-list-note">Weekly curated dinners pairing you with 5 strangers at a surprise restaurant.</span></li>
            <li><a href="/social-friend-clubs/#meatless-meetup">Meatless Meetup</a><span class="link-list-note">Social events for vegetarians and vegans. 5,400+ members and growing.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="panel">
          <h2 class="panel-title">Get creative</h2>
          <ul class="panel-body link-list">
            <li><a href="/creative-art/#draw-around-vancouver">Draw Around Vancouver</a><span class="link-list-note">Drawing circles, creative flow workshops, and still life sessions. Slow, alcohol-free, beginner-friendly.</span></li>
            <li><a href="/writing/#shut-up-%26-write!-vancouver">Shut Up & Write! Vancouver</a><span class="link-list-note">Quiet writing time followed by chat at VPL Central. Accepting, supportive, judgment-free.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="panel">
          <h2 class="panel-title">Learn something</h2>
          <ul class="panel-body link-list">
            <li><a href="/book-clubs/#silent-book-club">Silent Book Club</a><span class="link-list-note">People gather to read silently together, then chat. Introvert-friendly, low-pressure social.</span></li>
            <li><a href="/philosophy-intellectual/#vancouver-philosophy-salon">Vancouver Philosophy Salon</a><span class="link-list-note">Philosophical dialogue and friendly debate covering wide variety of topics from Plato to Buddha.</span></li>
            <li><a href="/chess/#vancouver-beer-%26-chess">Vancouver Beer & Chess</a><span class="link-list-note">Chess + drinks in a social setting. "We play chess and get to know people who like chess."</span></li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="panel">
          <h2 class="panel-title">Find your community</h2>
          <ul class="panel-body link-list">
            <li><a href="/run-clubs/#vancouver-frontrunners">Vancouver Frontrunners</a><span class="link-list-note">Inclusive running and walking group. No-drop policy, LGBTQ+ friendly.</span></li>
            <li><a href="/board-games/#vancouver-gaymers">Vancouver Gaymers</a><span class="link-list-note">2SLGBTQIA+ gaming community. Board games, video games, and social events.</span></li>
            <li><a href="/mens-groups/#the-dudes-club">The DUDES Club</a><span class="link-list-note">Men's talking circles focused on health and wellness. Participant-led community of brotherhood.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside class="col-side">
        <section class="panel">
          <h2 class="panel-title">Ready for more?</h2>
          <ul class="panel-body link-list link-list-tight">
            <li><a href="/">Browse all {{ totalGroups }}+ groups</a></li>
            <li><a href="/submit/">Add a group you know about</a></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="link-button" onclick="goRandom()" data-umami-event="click-surprise" data-umami-event-source="start-here">Show me a random group</button></li>
          </ul>
        </section>

